WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.070
The Dog and his Bone

2
00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:06.670
[A version of the tale by TheFableCottage.com]

3
00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:13.110
A dog is walking down the street,  when he sees a bone in a trash can.

4
00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:18.430
“A bone! Yippee! How lucky for me!” he thinks.

5
00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:22.600
He grabs the bone, and happily runs home.

6
00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:28.130
He runs past the train station and the school.

7
00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:30.880
He runs through the park.

8
00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.940
He runs onto a bridge.

9
00:00:34.490 --> 00:00:39.680
On the bridge, the dog looks down into the  deep, still water below.

10
00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:44.030
There, he sees another dog with a bone in its mouth.

11
00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:48.370
“Who is that dog?” he wonders.

12
00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.300
"What is he doing down there?"

13
00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.100
The dog stares at the other dog.

14
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.000
The other dog stares back.

15
00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:03.920
“Where did that dog get such a BIG bone?”  the dog wonders.

16
00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:07.730
"Why is his bone bigger than mine?"

17
00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:11.130
The dog growls at the other dog.

18
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.690
The other dog growls too.

19
00:01:15.370 --> 00:01:18.980
“I want that big bone!” he thinks.

20
00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:23.800
The greedy dog decides to steal the other dog's bone.

21
00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:27.610
He leaps off the bridge and into the water.

22
00:01:27.610 --> 00:01:29.610
Splash!

23
00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:35.420
But as soon as he hits the water, the other dog disappears.

24
00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:38.240
There was never any other dog.

25
00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:41.200
It was just his own reflection!

26
00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:46.050
The water is very deep and the dog is surprised.

27
00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:49.690
“Woof woof woof! Help!” he barks.

28
00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:53.200
And when he barks, his bone drops from his mouth

29
00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:56.130
— and sinks to the bottom of the water.

30
00:01:56.370 --> 00:01:58.450
The dog swims to shore.

31
00:01:58.590 --> 00:02:00.590
He is wet and cold,

32
00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:04.130
and now he has no bone at all.

33
00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:07.220
Moral:

34
00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:09.340
Be happy with what you have.

35
00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:13.060
If you're greedy, you might lose everything.
